unified-mcp-server combines code from two projects by waxz1992:

- mcp-file-edit (MIT, see LICENSE-MIT)
  https://github.com/waxz/mcp-file-edit
  -> src/unified_mcp_server/files/, common/models.py, common/os_utils.py,
     common/path_utils.py

- shell-mcp-server (Apache License 2.0, see LICENSE-APACHE)
  https://github.com/waxz/shell-mcp-server
  -> src/unified_mcp_server/shell/, common/mcp_types_utils.py

Files from both projects were modified for this package: imports and
configuration were unified, and bugs were fixed (see README.md, "Changes from
the original projects"). Each file taken from shell-mcp-server carries a
notice saying so.
